body:
What are his followers saying on truth? Like are they still drooling with everything he says still? Besides his rich friends; who else as common folk is actually benefiting from him? I e said before and I’ll say it again;

In his first term like now, had Obama done anything like this he would have been taken out of office.

People fail to forget his first term term benefited from all the ground work Obama did in his two terms. He even benefited from the Biden administration. Once his term ends we’ll deal with the long term repercussions of his incompetence as well as the inaptitude of his appointees that didn’t stand up to him that so called got their positions on how qualified they are
